;; cashrealestateconsulting.com — GitHub Pages records ONLY
;;
;; Import this file in the Cloudflare dashboard:
;;   cashrealestateconsulting.com zone -> DNS -> Records ->
;;   Import and Export -> Import DNS records
;;
;; SAFETY: This file is ADDITIVE. A Cloudflare import only ADDS the records
;; listed below — it never deletes or modifies existing records. This file
;; contains NO MX, NO TXT, NO SPF/DKIM/DMARC records, so importing it cannot
;; touch your email configuration.
;;
;; IMPORTANT — before importing, do these two things by hand (see dns/README.md):
;;   1. Delete exactly ONE existing record: the proxied apex CNAME
;;      "cashrealestateconsulting.com -> www.cashconsults.com" (per the
;;      2026-07-07 zone export it is the only web record; there is no "www"
;;      record). Touch NOTHING else — leave every MX and TXT record alone
;;      (Cloudflare Email Routing MX x3, SPF, DKIM, DMARC, Canva TXT).
;;   2. When importing, UNCHECK "Proxy imported DNS records" so these come in
;;      as DNS-only (grey cloud). GitHub cannot issue the HTTPS certificate
;;      while Cloudflare is proxying the records.

$ORIGIN cashrealestateconsulting.com.
$TTL 300

;; Apex -> GitHub Pages (IPv4)
cashrealestateconsulting.com.	300	IN	A	185.199.108.153
cashrealestateconsulting.com.	300	IN	A	185.199.109.153
cashrealestateconsulting.com.	300	IN	A	185.199.110.153
cashrealestateconsulting.com.	300	IN	A	185.199.111.153

;; Apex -> GitHub Pages (IPv6)
cashrealestateconsulting.com.	300	IN	AAAA	2606:50c0:8000::153
cashrealestateconsulting.com.	300	IN	AAAA	2606:50c0:8001::153
cashrealestateconsulting.com.	300	IN	AAAA	2606:50c0:8002::153
cashrealestateconsulting.com.	300	IN	AAAA	2606:50c0:8003::153

;; www -> the GitHub Pages user domain
www.cashrealestateconsulting.com.	300	IN	CNAME	gignsky.github.io.
